    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "With this effect, your opponent's memory will no longer increase by any effects except Tamer effects. This effect affects the opponent player.",
        "question": "What does the \"your opponent can't gain memory other than by Tamer effects\" effect do, exactly?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.When an effect is activated on a card that's treated as both a Digimon and a Tamer, the effect is treated as both a Digimon effect and a Tamer effect, therefore you can gain memory.",
        "question": "Can I gain memory using an effect on a Tamer that's treated as a Digimon with X000 DP due to an effect while my opponent has \"your opponent can't gain memory other than by Tamer effects\" activated?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
